Package: diseaseWatch
Type: Package
Title: Analyze Infectious Disease Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Avantika", "Sahoo",
      email = "sahooa@tamu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for cleaning, analyzing, and visualizing infectious disease 
    data. This package provides functions to assist public health analysts in
    calculating disease metrics, identifying trends, and generating
    consolidated reports. Expected input is a tabular dataset containing
    reporting dates, geographic regions, recorded case counts, and population
    sizes.
